      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Calls for monitoring the toxicity of combined preventive therapies and for child-specific monitoring tools. Table 4 lists reference prices and sources for key commodities in the package, such as isoniazid and co-trimoxazole, followed by useful resources.",
